					<description><![CDATA[我們致力耕耘精密模具，有幸在市場上取得了客戶的信賴，由於擁有廣大客戶支持，得以讓我們不斷在硬體與軟體上追求創新... &#187; <a class="read-more-link" href="/2020/10/29/scope-of-our-services/">閱讀全文</a>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>我們致力耕耘精密模具，有幸在市場上取得了客戶的信賴，由於擁有廣大客戶支持，得以讓我們不斷在硬體與軟體上追求創新。</p>



<p>我們全力開發模具設計、開模、組模方面的技術，期待能提供客戶更迅捷、便利的服務。我們擁有精準的模組專業，可以為客戶省去模組的不便，減低失誤率，確實替客戶將生產時間縮短，有效提升產能，擴充服務價值。</p>



<p>We dedicated ourselves on precision molding and earned our reputation. Due to the patronage  of our vast customer base. We are able to continuously seek innovation on hardware as well as software.</p>



<p>We focus our efforts on the developments of design, molding ang technologies of assembly, in hoe that we are able to provide fater and better services to our customers.</p>



<p>We are the precision mold maker. We are here to ease the inconveniences of mold assembly and cus down the faults making sure that our customers bring up the production efficiency and shorten the production time.</p>



